    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37941" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπακ-τέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must bring upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμον τῇ χώρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cic.
					<u>Att.</u>
					9.4.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must apply,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο ἐ., ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.135
				</span></i>
			.</div>
